==Awards==
{{see also|FIFA Intercontinental Cup awards}}

The following awards were given at the conclusion of the tournament. [[Vinícius Júnior]] of [[Real Madrid CF|Real Madrid]] won the Golden Ball award, sponsored by [[Adidas]], which was jointly awarded with the [[Saudi Aramco|Aramco]] Player of the Tournament to recognise the best player of the Intercontinental Cup.<ref>{{cite news |url=https://www.fifa.com/en/tournaments/mens/fifa-club-world-cup/articles/real-madrid-pachuca-report-final |title=Real Madrid beat Pachuca to win Intercontinental Cup |website=FIFA.com |publisher=Fédération Internationale de Football Association|date=18 December 2024 |access-date=18 December 2024}}</ref>

